Error [E1338]: This loadable library was built by Jet `0.0.1-old`, but the loading program uses Jet `1.0.0`
 Why: A `.jetlib` artifact pins the exact compiler identity that built it (D-LIB-REUSE1=B) — Jet makes no cross-version binary layout promise, so a mismatched artifact is refused before it is mapped
 Fix: Rebuild the library with the loading program's Jet version, or install a matching Jet toolchain
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1338
